  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "簡報技巧與溝通",
    "sub_ename": "PRESENTATION SKILL AND COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將向學生介紹使用英語的演講 ，且將重點關注幾個不同的領域，包括：演講類型，結構，常用詞彙和語法，肢體語言，視覺媒體， PowerPoint（或其他演講軟體）投影片設計以及如何處理問題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce students to presentations using English. There are several different areas the course will focus on including: presentation types, structure, commonly used vocabulary and grammar, body language, visual media, PowerPoint (or other presentation software) slide design and how to deal with questions.",
