    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "Description of scoring rules:1. Attendance: Consistent attendance, including punctuality, is paramount.2. Classroom Interaction: Active participation in the class discussions is crucial for this course.3. Group Work: Effective collaboration and constructive participation during group activities and presentations are essential.4. and insightful input in discussions and group work, emphasizing quality over quantity.",
